---
import founder from '../assets/founder.svg';
---

<section class="about" id="studio">
	<div class="container split">
		<div class="portrait reveal">
			<img src={founder.src} alt="Alex Carter, founder of Vertex" />
			<div class="badge">
				<span class="pulse"></span>
				The founder
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="bio">
			<p class="eyebrow reveal">The Studio</p>
			<h2 class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.08s">
				Founded by a builder,<br />run like a <span class="serif-accent">lab.</span>
			</h2>
			<p class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.16s">
				I'm Alex — I started Vertex in 2017 after one too many beautiful websites
				that moved no numbers. So I built the studio I kept wishing existed:
				engineers who think like marketers, and marketers who read the source code.
			</p>
			<p class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.22s">
				Nine years and 140+ launches later, the rule hasn't changed: every pixel
				must earn its place, and every build must move a metric. No account
				managers, no hand-offs into the void — you work directly with the people
				writing your code.
			</p>
			<ul class="facts reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.3s">
				<li><span>01</span>Senior-only team — no juniors on your build</li>
				<li><span>02</span>Based in Austin, working worldwide</li>
				<li><span>03</span>You talk to builders, not middlemen</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="signature reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.36s">Alex Carter</p>
			<p class="role reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.4s">Founder & Principal Engineer</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about { padding: 120px 0; }
	.split {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
		gap: 80px;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.portrait {
		position: relative;
		border-radius: 20px;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		box-shadow: 0 30px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
	}
	.portrait img { width: 100%; height: auto; }
	.badge {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 18px; left: 18px;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 9px;
		background: rgba(12, 12, 16, 0.8);
		backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: 100px;
		padding: 9px 18px;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 12px;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.pulse {
		width: 8px; height: 8px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--lime);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(200, 255, 46, 0.5);
		animation: pulse 2.4s infinite;
	}
	@keyframes pulse {
		0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(200, 255, 46, 0.5); }
		70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(200, 255, 46, 0); }
		100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(200, 255, 46, 0); }
	}
	.bio h2 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.2rem);
		margin: 22px 0 26px;
	}
	.bio p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 18px; max-width: 54ch; }
	.facts {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 32px 0 40px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
	}
	.facts li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 20px;
		padding: 16px 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
		font-size: 15px;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.facts li span {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 12px;
		color: var(--lime);
	}
	.signature {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 42px;
		color: var(--text) !important;
		margin-bottom: 2px !important;
		line-height: 1;
	}
	.role {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 12px;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	@media (max-width: 920px) {
		.split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 50px; }
		.portrait { max-width: 440px; }
	}
</style>
